    n_systems: int | None = ...,
    variances_m2: Sequence[float] | None = ...,
) -> RaimResult:
    """Residual chi-square RAIM.

    By default (`weights=None`) each residual is divided by the standard
    deviation the estimator weighted it by, from `variances_m2`, as RTKLIB
    demo5 `valsol` forms `sum (v / sigma)^2`; residuals without variances are
    refused with `ValueError`. `weights="unit"` treats every sigma as 1 m; a
    dict (or `RaimWeights.by_satellite`) gives per-satellite inverse-variance
    weights, with omitted satellites at unit weight.
    """
    ...

